  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Higher education capacity building project in Mongolian Life Science University</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of the mid-to-long-term sustainable development plan with a focus on industry-academe collaboration of the College of Animal Science &amp; Biotechnology, Mongolian University of Life Sciences, (Output2) Establishment of Livestock Technology Support Center and build a foundation for R&amp;D experiments and training, (Output3) High-level livestock experts trained and start-up capacity strengthened</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To achieve capacity-building of industry-academic-linkage-type higher education of Mongolian University of Life Sciences,  To contribute to the sustainable development of the livestock raising industry of Mongolia.&#xCD95;&#xC0B0;&#xB300;&#xD559;&#xC758; &#xC0B0;&#xD559;&#xC5F0;&#xACC4; &#xC5F0;&#xAD6C;&#xC5ED;&#xB7C9; &#xAC15;&#xD654;</narrative>
